{"id":"cb3f50bafebb1dd5","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-rule-admissibility.md","title":"有限推理族的可采纳性","display":"df-rule-admissibility — 有限推理族的可采纳性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-rule-admissibility","aliases":["72-df-rule-admissibility"],"display":"df-rule-admissibility — 有限推理族的可采纳性","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4, print36–46/PDF48–58; local abstract formulation of admissibility","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记","review_2026_10_23_book_recheck":"新增规则标签排除保留ax，保证扩充落在Proof接口定义域"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-rule-admissibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-rule-admissibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rule-admissibility — 有限推理族的可采纳性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4, print36–46/PDF48–58; local abstract formulation of admissibility"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23_book_recheck","html":"新增规则标签排除保留ax，保证扩充落在Proof接口定义域"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 是本册带标签演算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}((\\mathsf{Tag}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf{ax}\\})\\times W\\times Q^n\\times Q)\">\\(\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}((\\mathsf{Tag}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf{ax}\\})\\times W\\times Q^n\\times Q)\\)</span> 为有限元数规则实例族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tag},W\">\\(\\mathsf{Tag},W\\)</span> 为给定集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\vdash q\">\\(\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\)</span> 使用有限证明树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(D_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD_{\\mathcal C}&amp;:=\\{q\\in Q:\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq D_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow q\\in D_{\\mathcal C}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD_{\\mathcal C}&amp;:=\\{q\\in Q:\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq D_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow q\\in D_{\\mathcal C}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可采纳性只要求规则把可证前提送到可证结论，不预设统一的短证明变换，也不等同于规则已经列在演算内。零前提规则要求结论本来可证。有限前提范围将在扩充不增加定理的证明中实际使用。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23 接口复核：新增规则族的标签现在明确排除保留的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ax}\">\\(\\mathsf{ax}\\)</span>。上游 Proof_tree 只对公理标签与规则标签不交的演算构造证明接口；此前 U 的参数域未保证扩充后仍落在该接口内。例如零前提的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\mathsf{ax},w,\\langle\\rangle,q\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\mathsf{ax},w,\\langle\\rangle,q\\rangle\\)</span> 满足旧 U 的显示类型，却与公理叶标签的互斥约定冲突。这是扩充对象的定义域缺口，不是有限树归纳本身的反例。现有可采纳性定义及其对合法扩充的意义保持不变，零前提普通规则仍允许。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}((\\mathsf{Tag}\\setminus\\{\\mathsf{ax}\\})\\times W\\times Q^n\\times Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tag},W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\vdash q","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD_{\\mathcal C}&:=\\{q\\in Q:\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq D_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow q\\in D_{\\mathcal C}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\mathsf{ax},w,\\langle\\rangle,q\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":2353,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本轮内容修订：[[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本轮内容修订：[[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本轮内容修订：[[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]。"},{"id":"48e14346571b392f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原摘要列出的 3 个修订文件是 [[72-df-rule-admissibility]]、[[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] 和 [[72-thm-reflection-principle-proof-theory]]；摘要说明修订涉及合法规则标签域及算术反映句接口。它另声称复用了哈希吻合的既有全文记录。当前附件没有提供该历史哈希账本或原报告，本记录不把该声称升级为本次核验结果。"},{"id":"79374490721c4e4f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C,\\mathcal U,D_{\\mathcal C}$ 沿用 [[72-df-rule-admissibility]]；演算加规则的 $+$ 保持同一判断集合 $Q$，并沿用上游明确的 $\\mathsf{ax}$ 保留标签排除条件；因此 $\\mathcal C+\\mathcal U$ 仍属于有限证明树接口允许的带标签演算域。"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4","c60a11e47ac58326"]}